EXCEPTION: records derived from the SWCPQ dataset (added 2026-11-15)

The 59 ground-truth character records whose subtype is "open_psychometrics"
(stored in both data/ground_truth/ and data/aperture-data-v1/ground_truth/,
and in any data archive that contains those directories) are derived from
the Statistical "Which Character" Personality Quiz (SWCPQ) Features
Aggregated Dataset published by Open Psychometrics
(https://openpsychometrics.org/tests/characters/data/).

Those records are NOT licensed under CC BY 4.0. They remain subject to the
dataset's own license, Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
NoDerivatives 4.0 International (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0), as stated in the
dataset's codebook. Earlier versions of this repository labeled them
"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0" inside the files and included them under the CC BY 4.0
license below; both were errors. We are asking Open Psychometrics for
permission to redistribute them; if permission is not given, they will be
removed in a future release. Summary statistics computed from them (for
example the correlations in paper_artifacts/) are not affected.

